# keeps git, env files and caches out of the build context, at any depth
**/.git
**/.env*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.import_linter_cache

# keeps agent files and the docs out, except the two paths the image copies
.claude
docs
!docs/contract
!docs/base/requirements-to-tests.md
